msgid "Other command…"
msgstr "Anden kommando…"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "Command"
msgstr "Kommando"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "Google account"
msgstr "Google-konto"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml ../contents/ui/config/ConfigViews.qml
msgid "Default"
msgstr "Standard"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Join buttons open Google Meet links there; other meeting links open in the "
"default browser. In a command, %u stands for the meeting link. Google "
"account: its number (0, 1, …) or email, as in Google's account switcher; "
"empty uses the app's default."
msgstr ""
"Deltag-knapper åbner Google Meet-links her; andre mødelinks åbnes i "
"standardbrowseren. I en kommando står %u for mødelinket. Google-konto: dens "
"nummer (0, 1, …) eller e-mail som i Googles kontoskifter; tom bruger appens "
"standard."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "Meetings"
msgstr "Møder"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "Open the meeting link when a meeting starts"
msgstr "Åbn mødelinket, når et møde starter"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "For meetings you accepted or organize, not marked as ended."
msgstr ""
"For møder, du har accepteret eller arrangerer, og som ikke er markeret som "
"afsluttet."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "Do Not Disturb during meetings"
msgstr "Forstyr ikke under møder"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid ""
"Plasma's Do Not Disturb from the start until the end of a meeting with "
"guests or a meeting link. Mark as Ended turns it off."
msgstr ""
"Plasmas \"Forstyr ikke\" fra starten til slutningen af et møde med gæster "
"eller et mødelink. \"Markér som afsluttet\" slår det fra."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "Only meetings I accepted"
msgstr "Kun møder, jeg har accepteret"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "Invitations"
msgstr "Invitationer"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "New invitations for today"
msgstr "Nye invitationer i dag"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid ""
"A notification for each meeting today you haven't answered yet, with Yes, "
"Maybe and No."
msgstr ""
"En underretning for hvert møde i dag, du ikke har svaret på endnu, med Ja, "
"Måske og Nej."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "Daily Agenda"
msgstr "Daglig agenda"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "Today's events every morning"
msgstr "Dagens begivenheder hver morgen"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid ""
"A notification with today's events once a day, also when the computer is "
"turned on later."
msgstr ""
"En underretning med dagens begivenheder én gang om dagen, også når "
"computeren først tændes senere."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "At"
msgstr "Kl."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "All Event Notifications"
msgstr "Alle bekendtgørelser om begivenheder"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "\"Join meeting\" and \"Open in Calendar\" buttons"
msgstr "Knapperne \"Deltag i møde\" og \"Åbn i kalender\""

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "Skip all-day events"
msgstr "Spring heldagsbegivenheder over"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "Skip events I declined"
msgstr "Spring begivenheder over, som jeg har afvist"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid ""
"Popups and sounds for each kind of notification can also be set in System "
"Settings > Notifications > Event Calendar."
msgstr ""
"Pop op-vinduer og lyde for hver slags bekendtgørelse kan også indstilles i "
"Systemindstillinger > Bekendtgørelser > Event Calendar."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Google Account"
msgstr "Google-konto"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Google Account %1"
msgstr "Google-konto %1"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Login failed: %1"
msgstr "Login mislykkedes: %1"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Login complete."
msgstr "Login fuldført."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Could not prepare Google login: %1"
msgstr "Kunne ikke forberede Google-login: %1"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Waiting for browser callback..."
msgstr "Venter på tilbagekald fra browseren..."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Waiting for the helper page to send the code..."
msgstr "Venter på, at hjælpesiden sender koden..."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Sign-in timed out. Try again."
msgstr "Login fik timeout. Prøv igen."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Auto login failed. See logs for details."
msgstr "Automatisk login mislykkedes. Se logfilerne for detaljer."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Auto login failed: invalid callback data."
msgstr "Automatisk login mislykkedes: ugyldige tilbagekaldsdata."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Auto login failed: %1"
msgstr "Automatisk login mislykkedes: %1"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Auto login failed: authorization code missing."
msgstr "Automatisk login mislykkedes: godkendelseskode mangler."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid ""
"The desktop could not open the browser automatically. Use the login link in "
"Advanced sign-in options instead."
msgstr ""
"Skrivebordet kunne ikke åbne browseren automatisk. Brug i stedet login-"
"linket under Avancerede login-indstillinger."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid ""
"Sign in to show your Google calendars and task lists. Your browser opens to "
"sign in; when access is granted the widget picks it up automatically."
msgstr ""
"Log ind for at vise dine Google-kalendere og opgavelister. Din browser åbnes "
"til login; når adgang er givet, opfanger widgetten det automatisk."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Sign In Again"
msgstr "Log ind igen"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Reload calendars and task lists"
msgstr "Genindlæs kalendere og opgavelister"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Remove Account"
msgstr "Fjern konto"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Remove"
msgstr "Fjern"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid ""
"Google access for this account expired or was revoked. Sign in again to "
"reconnect it (the account and its settings are kept)."
msgstr ""
"Google-adgangen for denne konto er udløbet eller tilbagekaldt. Log ind igen "
"for at genforbinde den (kontoen og dens indstillinger bevares)."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "The widget was updated. Sign in again to keep this account in sync."
msgstr ""
"Widgetten er blevet opdateret. Log ind igen for at holde denne konto "
"synkroniseret."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "No calendars loaded yet. Use the reload button."
msgstr "Ingen kalendere indlæst endnu. Brug genindlæsningsknappen."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Task Lists"
msgstr "Opgavelister"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Add Account…"
msgstr "Tilføj konto…"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Sign in with Google…"
msgstr "Log ind med Google…"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Waiting for the browser sign-in…"
msgstr "Venter på login i browseren…"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Advanced sign-in options"
msgstr "Avancerede login-indstillinger"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Your own Google OAuth client, or pasting the sign-in code by hand"
msgstr "Din egen Google OAuth-klient, eller indsæt login-koden manuelt"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Client Credentials"
msgstr "Klientoplysninger"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid ""
"Using a previously stored Google OAuth client for compatibility. If login "
"still fails, add your own client ID and client secret."
msgstr ""
"Bruger en tidligere gemt Google OAuth-klient af hensyn til kompatibilitet. "
"Hvis login stadig mislykkes, så tilføj dit eget klient-id og din "
"klienthemmelighed."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Try desktop built-in client (no secret)"
msgstr "Prøv skrivebordets indbyggede klient (ingen hemmelighed)"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Client ID"
msgstr "Klient-id"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Optional"
msgstr "Valgfrit"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Client Secret"
msgstr "Klienthemmelighed"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid ""
"Leave these empty to use the built-in client. A custom client must be a "
"Google Cloud OAuth Desktop client, or a Web client with its secret and the "
